1076
00:43:20.640 --> 00:43:26.680
Being Muslim and growing up in Saudi, I still resonated and connected to Western sitcoms, dramas, and television in general.
作为穆斯林并在沙特长大，我对西方情景喜剧、剧情片以及整体电视剧仍然有着强烈的共鸣和连接。

1077
00:43:26.840 --> 00:43:28.020
So many of us did.
我们当中有很多人都是如此。

1078
00:43:28.020 --> 00:43:31.220
The show has a big fan base here, too.
这部剧在这里也有庞大的粉丝群体。

1079
00:43:31.800 --> 00:43:37.720
But there was always this distance, not from me to it, but from it to me, if that makes any sense.
但总存在着这样一种距离，不是我到它的距离，而是它到我的距离，如果这讲得通的话。

1080
00:43:37.980 --> 00:43:43.620
You guys had experienced a different perspective on my people, and it was reinforced by harsh stereotypes and propaganda.
你们对我们的人民有着不同的视角体验，而这种体验又被严厉的刻板印象和宣传所加固。

1081
00:43:44.000 --> 00:43:48.740
As we see how dark the world has gotten, your guys' podcast has brightened this era we're in.
当我们看到这个世界变得多么黑暗时，你们的播客照亮了我们身处的这个时代。

1082
00:43:48.920 --> 00:43:52.200
I deeply appreciate your intellect and your ability to connect.
我深深赞赏你们的才智和连接能力。

1083
00:43:52.540 --> 00:43:55.160
I feel joy, laughter, and hope watching you reflect.
看着你们的反思，我感受到了快乐、欢笑和希望。

1084
00:43:55.400 --> 00:43:57.040
Give credit where credit is due.
该记功劳的时候就得记。

1085
00:43:57.040 --> 00:44:00.560
This is the only show where I feel the crew is also famous.
这是唯一一个让我觉得幕后团队也很出名的节目。

1086
00:44:01.120 --> 00:44:07.980
Hearing you guys take accountability for the, I'll call it, the comedy of the times, that's very kind.
听着你们为那些——我称之为——时代的喜剧承担责任，真是太难得了。

1087
00:44:08.600 --> 00:44:11.700
I really appreciate how lovely and genuine you guys are.
我真的很感激你们的可爱与真诚。

1088
00:44:11.700 --> 00:44:19.840
I love that although it was always clear to me that Barney's character was a satire and deeply flawed and broken, you still get to see growth, not just in him,
我喜欢的是，尽管我一直很清楚巴尼这个角色充满讽刺、缺陷重重且心灵破碎，但你仍然能看到成长，不仅在他身上，

1089
00:44:19.900 --> 00:44:20.940
but in all the characters.
而且在所有角色身上。

1090
00:44:21.160 --> 00:44:23.480
And that is the reason the show has such longevity.
这就是这部剧能够历久弥新的原因。

1091
00:44:23.740 --> 00:44:31.860
The writing, the acting, directing, editing, design, music, and more all came together to make this beautiful thing that means so much in this lifetime we all share.
编剧、表演、导演、剪辑、设计、音乐等等完美结合，造就了这个美好的事物，在我们共同度过的一生中意义非凡。

1092
00:44:31.860 --> 00:44:40.860
I also really appreciate the way your podcast is two men talking about life and relationships and all the things in between, and it feels like a really healthy place.
我也非常欣赏你们的播客形式，是两个男人在探讨生活、人际关系以及介于两者之间的种种，感觉这是一个非常健康的阵地。

1093
00:44:41.080 --> 00:44:46.020
It feels safe and smart, allowing listeners to learn and reflect themselves.
它让人感到安全和智慧，能让听众去学习和自我反思。

1094
00:44:46.500 --> 00:44:51.280
So, again, thank you, and I hope this reaches you exactly when you needed to read it.
所以，再次谢谢你们，希望这条信息能在你最需要阅读它的时刻传达给你。

